STYLE
::cue { background-color: rgba(247,241,227,0.92); color:#28241E; font-family:"Lexend","Atkinson Hyperlegible",sans-serif; line-height:1.4; font-size:140%; font-weight:600; }

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.110
This is Reading Techniques.

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:08.265
Here you'll find practical techniques grounded in reading research,

00:00:08.295 --> 00:00:09.295
to help you read,

00:00:09.325 --> 00:00:11.350
understand, and focus better.

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:16.060
Browse the sections and choose any technique that suits you.

00:00:17.465 --> 00:00:19.755
It opens up simple steps to follow,

00:00:19.785 --> 00:00:20.915
one by one,

00:00:20.945 --> 00:00:23.340
with its research source alongside.

00:00:24.745 --> 00:00:26.025
Try the one that helps you,

00:00:26.055 --> 00:00:27.880
and come back to it whenever you need.
